// Agent V037 — Second Opinion Request SMS Responder
// SMS conversation type: Second Opinion Request  (slug: second_opinion_request)
// Signal in:  SMS_RESPONSE_SECOND_OPINION_REQUEST
// Signal out: CUSTOMER_SMS_REPLY (escalates by emitting CUSTOMER_SMS_ESCALATE
